    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d75">

                <pb facs="0086" n="80" xml:id="pg80"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Dun to Mr. Gresham.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 76.]</seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Tokyo</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1894-11-17"><hi rendition="#italic">November 17,
                        1894</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Japanese minister for foreign affairs requests in the event of China desiring to
                    approach Japan upon the subject of peace it shall be done though the legation of
                    the United States at Peking.</p>
            </div>
